BLAKE3 — portable reference port
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream:  https://github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3
Authors:   Jack O'Connor, Jean-Philippe Aumasson, Samuel Neves, Zooko
           Wilcox-O'Hearn
License:   CC0-1.0 OR Apache-2.0 OR Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
           (upstream is triple-licensed; any one may be chosen)

Files:
  source/infrastructure/utils/crypto/c/blake3.c
  source/infrastructure/utils/crypto/c/blake3.h
  source/infrastructure/utils/crypto/c/blake3_impl.h

These are a port of upstream's portable C implementation. Upstream's two-space
